  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S5-F  FEAR (FOUNDATION)
  body: 'Press G for labels. Press V: the bottom-left tag shows RANGED HITS CAUSE
    FEAR. Press 2 (Ranged), press Z to target the hunter and hold left-click.

    EXPECT:
    after 5 ranged hits in 6 seconds the hunter''s label shows FEARED and it runs
    away for 4 seconds, then returns. Press V again and nothing happens: ranged hits
    are plain Light attacks. This is only the foundation: the full Fear specialisation
    is Phase 3.'
  radius: 3
